 "description": "<p>Three tens stacked in one blossom: ten strong vibration modes, ten sucking modes, and ten frequency patterns, each running through the same flower-shaped body. The suction comes from internal bubbling vibration — pulses of airflow that pull at the clitoris rather than pressing on it — and the vibration layer adds depth underneath.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"Rose Clit Sucker Red\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/RoseClitSuckerRed_6_480x480.jpg?v=1689733407\"></p>\n<p>Because every layer is counted in tens, the toy scales cleanly. Low settings on both channels make a slow, rumbly warm-up; pushing suction and vibration toward the top of their ranges turns the same device into something far more insistent. There is no exotic technique to learn — one button cycles patterns, and the memory of the last combination holds.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"Rose Clit Sucker Red\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/RoseClitSuckerRed_3_b526c84a-7f48-4cd7-91bf-fe115d7cee56_480x480.jpg?v=1689733347\"></p>\n<p>The full-body waterproofing is the quiet convenience here: rinse it under the tap after use, take it into the shower mid-session, and never think about a charging brick thanks to the magnetic USB contact.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"Rose Clit Sucker Red\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/RoseClitSuckerRed_1_8f17c4a2-c21e-43ad-9e8b-af6eba5d7f0d_480x480.jpg?v=1689733355\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Vibration modes: 10</li>\n<li>Sucking modes: 10</li>\n<li>Frequency patterns: 10</li>\n<li>Charging: USB magnetic</li>\n<li>Waterproof: 100% waterproof body</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img alt=\"Rose Clit Sucker Red\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/RoseClitSuckerRed_2_3150853b-1575-4eb6-8855-8d4bca4ad335_480x480.jpg?v=1689733352\"><br />\n<img alt=\"Rose Clit Sucker Red\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/RoseClitSuckerRed_5_77ededec-1711-4f05-83a1-6c648520fc9a_480x480.jpg?v=1689733358\"></p>\n<p>A straightforward, fully-waterproof blossom for users who want numbers instead of nuance.</p>\n",
 "short_description": "<p>Rose blossom toy stacking 10 vibration, 10 sucking and 10 frequency modes with USB magnetic charging in a waterproof body.</p>\n",
